Authentication:
POST   /api/auth/login
POST   /api/auth/register
POST   /api/auth/oauth/google
POST   /api/auth/change-password

Users:
GET    /api/users/profile
PUT    /api/users/profile
GET    /api/users/search
POST   /api/users/students/bulk

Projects:
GET    /api/projects/my
POST   /api/projects
GET    /api/projects/:id
PUT    /api/projects/:id
DELETE /api/projects/:id
POST   /api/projects/:id/groups/generate
POST   /api/projects/:id/groups/manual

Groups:
GET    /api/projects/:projectId/groups
POST   /api/groups
GET    /api/groups/:id
PUT    /api/groups/:id
DELETE /api/groups/:id
POST   /api/groups/:id/join
POST   /api/groups/:id/leave
GET    /api/projects/:projectId/groups/stats

Deliverables:
POST   /api/deliverables
PUT    /api/deliverables/:id
POST   /api/deliverables/:id/submit
GET    /api/deliverables/:id/submissions
POST   /api/deliverables/:id/analyze-similarity

Statistics:
GET    /api/stats/users
GET    /api/stats/projects
GET    /api/stats/projects/:id